# Route: guide 13 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 34 to
# 35, 15 quests, 0.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ashenvale, The Barrens): Fallen Sky Lake -> Raynewood Retreat -> The
# Zoram Strand -> Ratchet -> The Crossroads -> The Forgotten Pools -> Bael
# Modan.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Allegiance to the Old Gods (6564;
# Blackfathom Tide Priestess 20-21).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blackfathom Villainy (6561), Allegiance to the Old Gods
# (6565), Allegiance to the Old Gods (6565), Amongst the Ruins (6921), Amongst
# the Ruins (6921), Baron Aquanis (6922), Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf
# Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate
# Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981).

